{"createdAt":"2026-08-01T18:46:04.206Z","offset":7185,"path":"/devices/m5sticks3","providerType":"response.output_audio_transcript.done","raw":"{\"type\":\"response.output_audio_transcript.done\",\"event_id\":\"715d3af7-5307-4e85-a577-fd5b655449c8\",\"item_id\":\"e8977392-081c-41a9-9ef8-760d3e991c1d\",\"transcript\":\"Once upon a time in a quiet village nestled between misty hills, there lived a curious fox named Finn who dreamed of seeing the stars up close. Every night he climbed the tallest oak, gazing upward with wonder, until one evening a glowing comet streaked across the sky and landed softly in a nearby meadow. Finn raced down and discovered the comet was actually a tiny star sprite named Lira who had fallen from her constellation and needed help finding her way home. Together they journeyed through whispering forests and sparkling rivers, meeting wise old owls and playful river otters who shared ancient maps of the night sky. With Lira's light guiding them and Finn's bravery lighting the path, they reached the mountain peak just as dawn approached. Lira soared back into the sky, leaving Finn with a glowing feather as a reminder that even the smallest dreams can touch the stars.\",\"response_id\":\"94218038-74af-4504-afc0-7e1fead62be1\",\"content_index\":0,\"output_index\":0,\"previous_item_id\":null}","receivedAtMs":1785609964195,"sequence":49,"sessionId":"prj_bd8785e119fe4f1d8631bb95e1dea748:m5sticks3:8800d232-85f2-454f-9b53-dd46fbf755f3","type":"events.iterate.com/kit/provider-event"}
